================================================================================
Removed proprietary components
================================================================================

The two proprietary XREAL native libraries (libota-lib.so, libnr_glasses_api.so)
and the verbatim Java shim that declared their `native` methods
(ai.nreal.glasses.control.*) have been REMOVED from this project. The camera-Eye
control protocol they implemented is now reimplemented in pure Kotlin
(com.raphael.handmouse.glasses.*) from this project's own black-box USB capture.
